# The repository stores LF (Prettier's default). Without this, Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true get CRLF and `pnpm format:check` fails locally (docs/audit-mvp.md R8).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.icns binary
